Selected Story
Nu�yon is an early-stage, AI-first software company building tools for other AI-first companies; its first concrete expression of that vision is Nu�yon.Compose, an intentionally narrow, AI-native orchestration workflow designed to turn researched ideas and accumulated knowledge into well-structured content. The reader should come away understanding Nu�yon's identity and direction, and how Compose-described at a conceptual level-makes that direction tangible without implying launched products or proven outcomes.

Story Progression
