- Development: Nu�yon.Compose is presented as the first concrete product direction: a staged, AI-native orchestration workflow that moves from Idea  Discover & Select  Research  Synthesize  Narrative  Compose to produce finished content. Emphasize that the initial implementation is deliberately narrow and focused on proving the core workflow rather than a broad feature set.
