Compose
-------

Nu�yon is an early-stage, AI-first software company building tools for other AI-first businesses. Its immediate, concrete expression of that direction is Nu�yon.Compose - an AI-native orchestration workflow aimed at turning researched ideas and accumulated knowledge into well-structured, finished content.

Compose is organized as a staged workflow: Idea  Discover & Select  Research  Synthesize  Narrative  Compose. The intent is to coordinate those distinct steps so raw ideas and gathered knowledge become coherent, publishable work without treating content production as a single LLM call.

The initial implementation is intentionally narrow. The focus is on demonstrating the core orchestration workflow rather than offering a broad feature set or a general platform. That narrowness is a way to make the company's AI-first direction tangible and manageable.

What this makes clear is Nu�yon's immediate orientation: orchestration-first design that treats content creation as a sequence of specialized stages. Compose is positioned as a foundation for that approach, not as a finished, validated product.

